#! ia 1.0

@phase orient
  meaning
    says "Establish the objective, context and constraints before selecting work."
    answers "What does orient designate in the phase domain?"
  data
    order 0

@phase plan
  meaning
    says "Derive a bounded approach and the evidence that will establish its result."
    answers "What does plan designate in the phase domain?"
  data
    order 1

@phase act
  meaning
    says "Perform the authorized work and observe its actual effects."
    answers "What does act designate in the phase domain?"
  data
    order 2

@phase learn
  meaning
    says "Compare the outcome with the intent and retain attributable knowledge."
    answers "What does learn designate in the phase domain?"
  data
    order 3

